# Code owners for eventing-lab.
#
# CODEOWNERS is NOT inherited from the org — GitHub requires it per-repo, so this file must
# name a real team or the repo gets no review assignment at all.
#
# Replace maintainers with the owning team (e.g. @rossoctl/eventing-lab-maintainers) and make sure the
# team has write access to this repo, or GitHub silently ignores these rules.

# Default owners for everything
* @rossoctl/maintainers

# The documentation convention and its gates. Changes here affect every contributor's
# workflow, so they get maintainer review.
/docs/README.md       @rossoctl/maintainers
/docs/specs/README.md @rossoctl/maintainers
/docs/adrs/           @rossoctl/maintainers
/CLAUDE.md            @rossoctl/maintainers

# CI and governance
/.github/             @rossoctl/maintainers
/scripts/             @rossoctl/maintainers
/LICENSE              @rossoctl/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md        @rossoctl/maintainers
